  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "主线程约束",
      "items": [
        "into 第一行就是 checkMain()；enqueueAndSubmit 里 cancelExistingRequest 也会再校验主线程",
        "目标与 Action 的映射放在 Picasso.targetToAction（WeakHashMap），换图即取消旧请求"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "线程模型：消息队列 + 线程池",
      "items": [
        "HandlerDispatcher 用专用 HandlerThread 串行处理 submit/cancel/retry，再交给 PicassoExecutorService",
        "PicassoFutureTask 实现 Comparable：HIGH 优先级排前，同优先级按 hunter.sequence 保证 FIFO"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "两级去重",
      "items": [
        "内存命中时 RequestCreator.into 直接 setResult，根本不创建 Action",
        "同一 key 的 hunter 由 BaseDispatcher.hunterMap 复用，后来的 Action 通过 BitmapHunter.attach 合并"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
